ttaa de7idi haiqqiis."]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["Heenoosi 90 laittaa de7idi, Qainaana yeliis;"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["Heenoosi Qainaana yelidoogaappe guyyiyan, 815 laittaa de7iis; hara attuma naatanne macca naata yeliis."]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["Heenoosi muleera 905 laittaa de7idi haiqqiis."]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["Qainaani 70 laittaa de7idi, Malaali7eela yeliis;"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["Qainaani Malaali7eela yelidoogaappe guyyiyan, 840 laittaa de7iis; hara attuma naatanne macca naata yeliis."]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["Qainaani muleera 910 laittaa de7idi haiqqiis."]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["Malaali7eeli 65 laittaa de7idi, Yaareeda yeliis;"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["Malaali7eeli Yaareeda yelidoogaappe guyyiyan, 830 laittaa de7iis; hara attuma naatanne macca naata yeliis."]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["Malaali7eeli muleera 895 laittaa de7idi haiqqiis."]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["Yaareedi 162 laittaa de7idi, Heenooka yeliis;"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["Yaareedi Heenooka yelidoogaappe guyyiyan, 800 laittaa de7iis; hara attuma naatanne macca naata yeliis."]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["Yaareedi muleera 962 laittaa de7idi haiqqiis."]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["Heenooki 65 laittaa de7idi, Maatusaala yeliis;"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["Maatusaala yelidoogaappe guyyiyan, Heenooki 300 laittaa Xoossaara hemettiiddi de7iis; hara attuma naatanne macca naata yeliis."]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["Heenooki muleera 365 laittaa de7iis;"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["i Xoossaara hemettiiddi xayi bayiis; aissi giikko, Xoossai a ekki efiis."]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["Maatusaali 187 laittaa de7idi, Laameeka yeliis;"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["Maatusaali Laameeka yelidoogaappe guyyiyan, 782 laittaa de7iis; hara attuma naatanne macca naata yeliis."]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["Maatusaali muleera 969 laittaa de7idi haiqqiis."]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":["Laameeki 182 laittaa de7idi, attuma na7a yeliis."]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["Yelidi, “Ha na7ai GODAI qanggido biittaa bollan nuna nu kushiyaa oosuwaa daafuraappe shemppissana” giidi Noha",{"noteId":9},"sunttiis."]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":["Laameeki Noha yelidoogaappe guyyiyan, 595 laittaa de7iis; hara attuma naatanne macca naata yeliis."]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":["Laameeki muleera 777 laittaa de7idi haiqqiis."]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":["Nohee 500 laittaa de7idi, Seema, Kaamanne Yaafeeta yeliis."]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":8,"caller":"9","text":"Asa: Ibraawetto qaalan “Asa” giyoogee “Addaama” giyoogaa.","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":2}},{"noteId":9,"caller":"10","text":"Noha: Ha sunttai “SHemppissiis” giyoogaa milatees.","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":29}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/wal_sim/GEN/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/wal_sim/GEN/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/wal_sim/GEN/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":32}